    "faq_q4XxCp": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_6eb8q6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What services do you offer?",
            "answer": "<p>At <strong>An Agency</strong>, we offer a comprehensive range of web development services tailored to the unique needs of businesses in Melbourne and beyond. Our services include:</p><ul><li><strong>Web Development:</strong> We craft visually stunning, highly functional websites that align with your brand and engage your audience.</li><li><strong>E-commerce Development:</strong> We design seamless online shopping experiences that drive sales and boost revenue for your business.</li><li><strong>Custom Web Applications:</strong> We develop custom web applications to meet your specific needs, from customer portals to internal management systems.</li><li><strong>Website Design:</strong> Our meticulous design process ensures every aspect of your site—layout, navigation, and aesthetics—is optimised for maximum impact.</li><li><strong>SEO Services:</strong> Improve your online visibility and attract organic traffic with expert SEO services, designed to enhance your search engine rankings.</li><li><strong>Content Writing:</strong> Our experienced writers create engaging content that enhances user engagement and strengthens your brand’s online presence.</li><li><strong>Responsive Design:</strong> We ensure your website performs flawlessly on all devices, from desktops to smartphones and tablets.</li><li><strong>Ongoing Support & Maintenance:</strong> After launch, we provide ongoing support and maintenance to keep your website updated and running smoothly.</li><li><strong>Conversion Rate Optimisation (CRO):</strong> Boost your site’s effectiveness with CRO strategies, optimising every element to turn visitors into customers.</li><li><strong>Mobile App Development:</strong> Expand your digital presence with our mobile app development services, creating intuitive apps for both iOS and Android.</li></ul>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_zgAUEF": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you provide ongoing maintenance and support?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we offer comprehensive post-launch services, including ongoing maintenance, updates, and troubleshooting. Our goal is to ensure your website stays optimised, secure, and fully functional over the long term.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Hxwk7R": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your development process like?",
            "answer": "<p>We start with an in-depth consultation to understand your goals and requirements. From there, we move into design, development, and thorough testing before launching your site. Post-launch, we offer ongoing support and maintenance to ensure everything runs smoothly.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_qQ7HXc": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I see examples of your work?",
            "answer": "<p>Of course! We have an extensive portfolio that highlights the variety of projects we’ve completed across different industries. It’s a great way to see the quality and impact of our work firsthand.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_ahHict": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where are you located, and do you work with clients outside of Melbourne?",
            "answer": "<p>Our team is based in Melbourne, but we proudly work with clients across Australia and internationally. Whether you’re local or global, we’re ready to bring your vision to life.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_dpcanW": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer SEO services to improve search rankings?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we provide tailored SEO strategies to help your website rank higher in search results, driving more organic traffic and ensuring maximum visibility for your business.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_zyJaTG": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much do your web development services cost?",
            "answer": "<p>Our pricing depends on factors such as project size, complexity, and the specific features you require. We provide tailored quotes to ensure your needs are met, but for transparency and a general starting point, please see our pricing page for a detailed breakdown.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_KXDtCh": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you assist with content writing for my website?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely! We offer professional content writing services, crafting compelling and engaging content to improve user experience and drive engagement on your website.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_DVE6fq": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does it take to build a website?",
            "answer": "<p>Timelines depend on the scope and complexity of the project. For most standard websites, we typically need <strong>2-3 weeks</strong> to create a beautiful, fully functional site. For more complex projects involving animations or custom coding, it can take <strong>3-5 weeks</strong>. After an initial consultation, we’ll provide a clear timeline tailored to your project.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
